      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Arthroscopy Association of North America. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Lateral-based hip disease is severely impairing for many patients. Treatment decision making requires a thorough understanding of the biomechanical and clinical interpretation of the physical examination. The outcomes of these under-recognized pathologies are explained with success. A recent study has described the diagnostic and surgical treatment outcomes of this impairing condition of partial and full-thickness gluteus medius tears."
      },
